From b2d7fbd25c5f5f6602e79247fd669cabb1d318c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fashionultraaura <fashionultraaura@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 14:52:04 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 06/11] design(env): fachada, jardim e luz ambiente interna
 (lote 5)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Casca externa sem colisao (reboco, soco de tijolo, cunhais, faixas), 55 janelas 3D,
telhado e varanda vestidos a cada nivel, muro de tijolo, grade de ferro, postes,
abóboras, cemiterio e arvores do jardim (pasta nao apagada pelo ForestBuilder).
Comodos sem energia ganham preenchimento ambiente quente.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
